  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">220023_WFP_FY22_Sudan_E.Darfur Food for Assets &amp; PSN_CLOSED</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity 1: Cash Based Transfers (CBT) and Food for Assets (FFA)
 
 Locality: El Neem, Yassin, Al Firdous, Asalya
 
  Activity 6: Productive Safety Net (PSN)
 
 Locality: El Daein: Um ramad and Al Galabi
 
 
 
 
 
 Goal:
 
 
 
 To save lives through improved food and nutrition status whilst restoring livelihoods and enhancing communities resilience to shocks amongst the vulnerable Internally Displaced Persons, residents and returnees in East Darfur. 
 
  
 
 The project goal aligns with WFP Sudan Country Strategic outcomes
 
 &amp;#252; Strategic Outcome 1; which states that people affected by shocks in targeted areas have access to food nutrition and livelihoods during after crises. 
 
 &amp;#252; Outcome 4; which states that food-insecure people in targeted areas and food systems have increased resilience to shocks by 2024</narrative>
  </description>
